# Elixir Koans - 01 Equalities

```elixir
import ExUnit.Assertions
```

## We shall contemplate truth by testing reality, via equality

```elixir
assert true == ___
```

## Not something is the opposite of it

```elixir
assert !true == ___
```

## To understand reality, we must compare our expectations against reality

```elixir
assert 2 == 1 + ___
```

## Some things may appear different, but be the same

```elixir
assert 1 == 2 / ___
```

## Unless they actually are different

```elixir
3.2 != ___
```

## Some may be looking for bigger things

```elixir
assert ___ > 3
```

## Others are happy with less

```elixir
assert ___ < 3
```

